UID:bat-202607171900-once-upon-a-mattress@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Many moons ago in a far-off place\, Queen Aggravain decreed
  no couples could marry until her son\, Prince Dauntless\, found a bride. 
 Princesses came from far and wide to win the hand of the prince\, but none
  could pass the impossible tests given to them by the Queen. That is\, unt
 il the “shy” swamp princess\, Winnifred the Woebegone\, showed up.
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater
